(7603269, 1228733, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photograph, but to me it sings almost the polar opposite of the title. I see the castle, the rocks, the man all rooted solidly to the earth, unable to shed the WEIGHT of being and rise into the ephemeral. And it sings THAT song superbly. Technically, the execution of the image is spectacular, the detailed tonality of the very dark areas allowing them to express both density and substance is to die for. But I don''t know what score to give. 6 to hold.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous photograph, but to me it sings almost the polar opposite of the title. I see the castle, the rocks, the man all rooted solidly to the earth, unable to shed the WEIGHT of being and rise into the ephemeral. And it sings THAT song superbly. Technically, the execution of the image is spectacular, the detailed tonality of the very dark areas allowing them to express both density and substance is to die for. But I don''t know what score to give. 6 to hold.', '2018-11-19 00:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
